{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.math.BigInteger;\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    private static int weight;\n    private static int itemMass;\n    private static final boolean[] used = new boolean[100];\n\n    static {\n        for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {\n            used[i] = false;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public boolean isBalanced() {\n        long left = itemMass;\n        long right = 0;\n\n        while (true) {\n            if (left > right) {\n                long diff = left - right;\n                long next = findWeight(diff);\n                if (next == 0) break;\n                right += next;\n            } else if (right > left) {\n                long diff = right - left;\n                long next = findWeight(diff);\n                if (next == 0) break;\n                left += next;\n            } else {\n                return true;\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    private long findWeight(long target) {\n        if (target <= 0) return 0;\n\n        int exponent = (int) (Math.log(target) / Math.log(weight));\n        BigInteger base = BigInteger.valueOf(weight);\n        BigInteger total = base.pow(exponent + 1).subtract(BigInteger.ONE).divide(BigInteger.valueOf(weight - 1));\n        long totalLong = total.longValue();\n\n        if (target > totalLong && !used[exponent + 1]) {\n            used[exponent + 1] = true;\n            return (long) Math.pow(weight, exponent + 1);\n        } else if (target <= totalLong && !used[exponent]) {\n            used[exponent] = true;\n            return (long) Math.pow(weight, exponent);\n        } else {\n            return 0;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        weight = scanner.nextInt();\n        itemMass = scanner.nextInt();\n        Main solver = new Main();\n        System.out.println(solver.isBalanced() ? \"YES\" : \"NO\");\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <vector>\n#include <limits>\n\nclass Main {\nprivate:\n    static int weight;\n    static int itemMass;\n    static std::vector<bool> used;\n\npublic:\n    bool isBalanced() {\n        long long left = itemMass;\n        long long right = 0;\n\n        while (true) {\n            if (left > right) {\n                long long diff = left - right;\n                long long next = findWeight(diff);\n                if (next == 0) break;\n                right += next;\n            } else if (right > left) {\n                long long diff = right - left;\n                long long next = findWeight(diff);\n                if (next == 0) break;\n                left += next;\n            } else {\n                return true;\n            }\n        }\n        return false;\n    }\n\nprivate:\n    long long findWeight(long long target) {\n        if (target <= 0) return 0;\n\n        int exponent = static_cast<int>(std::log(target) / std::log(weight));\n        \n        // Calculate total = (weight^(exponent+1) - 1) / (weight - 1)\n        long long total = 1;\n        long long power = 1;\n        for (int i = 0; i <= exponent; i++) {\n            power *= weight;\n        }\n        total = (power - 1) / (weight - 1);\n\n        if (target > total && !used[exponent + 1]) {\n            used[exponent + 1] = true;\n            long long result = 1;\n            for (int i = 0; i <= exponent; i++) {\n                result *= weight;\n            }\n            return result;\n        } else if (target <= total && !used[exponent]) {\n            used[exponent] = true;\n            long long result = 1;\n            for (int i = 0; i < exponent; i++) {\n                result *= weight;\n            }\n            return result;\n        } else {\n            return 0;\n        }\n    }\n\npublic:\n    static void main() {\n        std::cin >> weight >> itemMass;\n        \n        // Initialize used vector\n        used.assign(100, false);\n        \n        Main solver;\n        std::cout << (solver.isBalanced() ? \"YES\" : \"NO\") << std::endl;\n    }\n};\n\nint Main::weight;\nint Main::itemMass;\nstd::vector<bool> Main::used;\n\nint main() {\n    Main::main();\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.85\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00025602878304198384, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00022373080719262362, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0003081085451412946, -7.152555099310121e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.02985791116952896, -0.00043096792069263756, -0.0002317160106031224, -4.172316494077677e-06, -0.014855477958917618, -0.01603516936302185, -0.000554288737475872, -3.814689989667386e-06, -0.9503908157348633, -0.22829754650592804, -0.308743417263031, -0.020042400807142258, -8.511180931236595e-05, -0.0013904437655583024, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.0036016139201819897, -0.0001829695247579366, -2.6